Package: SEAC
Type: Package
Title: KD-Tree Quality Control and Gene-Set Co-Localization for Visium HD
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("SEAC", "Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maintainer@example.org")
    )
Description: Imports 10x Genomics Visium HD Space Ranger outputs, applies a
    KD-tree radius mask derived from capture-border and non-tissue positions,
    and evaluates a general MaxMin gene-set spatial co-localization statistic.
    A UMI-level Monte Carlo permutation test supports within-sample and
    pooled-sample null models while using disk-backed results and checkpoints.
